  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Entornos habilitantes del cuidado corresponsable</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project seeks to contribute to the construction and strengthening of enabling environments for co-responsible care at the levels of the municipalities of Cochabamba and Sacaba, the region of the upper Cochabamba valley, at the Cochabamba departmental level, but also with political and public advocacy actions at the national level, through participatory processes, multi-stakeholder spaces and networks that promote the recognition of care as a right and move towards the dismantling of gender roles traditional in Bolivia. It will work directly with and for 1,641 people.</narrative>
  </description>
